   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8122b842e36f201fa25d",
   "sourceHash": "8122b842e36f201fa25d3c008899881d421f2184b6f9344a8fa41d852ff6cdcb",
   "text": "帕拉卡德蕴藏着丰富的文化体验。您可以欣赏传统音乐和舞蹈表演，参观文化遗址，并参与当地节庆，例如：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3e53ecf88da758199a9a",
   "sourceHash": "3e53ecf88da758199a9a7d9a95cfa2c53d2d91518a42b9a1c38e050a46f5cbb5",
   "text": "卡尔帕蒂战车节（Kalpathy Ratholsavam）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_18d0db16caeb7af230a6",
   "sourceHash": "18d0db16caeb7af230a6fdb0f722463bd581cf1d325ddce3f965db3f7c7b204b",
   "text": "：在古老的卡尔帕蒂维什瓦纳塔斯瓦米神庙（Kalpathy Vishwanatha Swamy Temple）举行的盛大战车节。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9d85774e496ef32aebaf",
